The login theme (themes/chowkidar/login) is a child of Keycloak's keycloak.v2 login theme and the account theme
(themes/chowkidar/account) a child of its keycloak.v3 account theme. Each inherits the parent's other templates,
scripts, images and PatternFly-based stylesheets, which are not copied here and stay Keycloak's. The files under
themes/chowkidar/login whose names match Keycloak's (login-username.ftl, login-x509-info.ftl,
webauthn-authenticate.ftl) are Keycloak 26.4.4's templates, changed as each file's opening comment says.
Keycloak is Copyright Red Hat, Inc. and other contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The SVG marks under themes/chowkidar (the Chowkidar mark, its dark variant, the wordmark and the favicon) are
Chowkidar's own and are under the same licence. The name Chowkidar and the mark identify this project; the
licence does not grant their use to suggest that your product is this project or endorsed by it.
